      "widgets_values": [
        "Classic 2D animation in the exact style of South Park. Preserve the exact appearance, colors, cutout-paper style, proportions and identity of Eric Cartman, Stan Marsh, Kyle Broflovski and Kenny McCormick from the input image. Keep the original composition and bedroom background unchanged.\n\nScene:\nThe four boys are sitting in front of the computer, staring directly toward the camera as if they have noticed someone watching them.\n\nTimeline:\n\n[0s–1s]\nAll four boys stare silently at the camera. Cartman slowly narrows his eyes with an annoyed expression while the others remain still, blinking naturally.\n\n[1s–5.2s]\nONLY Eric Cartman speaks with accurate lip sync using his arrogant, slightly raspy voice. Cartman points directly toward the camera while speaking. Stan, Kyle and Kenny remain completely silent, only reacting with small eye movements and occasional blinks.\n\nDialogue:\n\"Hey... who's the idiot staring at us? Hey, you! Who are you? What do you want? Come on... scroll up already!\"\n\n[5.2s–6s]\nCartman stops talking, keeps staring at the camera with an impatient expression and taps the desk with one finger. The other boys continue looking at the viewer without speaking.\n\nCamera:\nSingle fixed shot. No cuts, no zoom, no camera movement.\n\nAnimation:\nClassic South Park cutout animation with simple body movement, natural blinking, limited but expressive gestures and accurate lip sync only for Cartman.\n\nKeep the original South Park style, colors, characters and background unchanged.\n\nNo new characters, no style changes, no realistic rendering, no CGI, no subtitles, no logos, no watermarks, no character deformation.",
        1344,
        768,
        7,
        1081039456885546,
        "minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors",
        "qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors",
        "minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors",
        "minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
